{"4909330": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Last Bake", "steam_appid": 4909330, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <strong>Last Bake</strong>, you play as a young woman taking a temporary evening job as a bakery clerk on New Year's Eve. A coffee machine, fresh hot pastries, and a handful of customers—what could possibly go wrong?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >STORY</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >On New Year's Eve, you take a temporary job at a local bakery while its owner and sole employee has to leave on urgent business. Keeping the place clean and serving the occasional customer seems like the perfect evening job. But as time passes, the once cozy bakery turns into your worst nightmare... Will this year's last bake be a successful one?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >GAMEPLAY</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A walking simulator featuring simple order preparation mechanics. Brew coffee using the coffee machine, fry and serve donuts with the correct filling. Keep the bakery clean and tidy, restock supplies in the storage room, and refill the display shelves.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FEATURES</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Nice graphics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Simple cooking mechanics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >New Year's atmosphere</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customer reviews</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Playtime</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >45–90 minutes</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > </h2>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <strong>Last Bake</strong>, you play as a young woman taking a temporary evening job as a bakery clerk on New Year's Eve. A coffee machine, fresh hot pastries, and a handful of customers—what could possibly go wrong?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >STORY</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >On New Year's Eve, you take a temporary job at a local bakery while its owner and sole employee has to leave on urgent business. Keeping the place clean and serving the occasional customer seems like the perfect evening job. But as time passes, the once cozy bakery turns into your worst nightmare... Will this year's last bake be a successful one?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >GAMEPLAY</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A walking simulator featuring simple order preparation mechanics. Brew coffee using the coffee machine, fry and serve donuts with the correct filling. Keep the bakery clean and tidy, restock supplies in the storage room, and refill the display shelves.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FEATURES</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Nice graphics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Simple cooking mechanics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >New Year's atmosphere</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customer reviews</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Playtime</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >45–90 minutes</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > </h2>", "short_description": "You play as a young woman taking a temporary evening job at a bakery on New Year's Eve. Your task is to serve a variety of customers while trying to uncover why, instead of holiday cheer, this place is shrouded in darkness...", "supported_languages": "English, German, Spanish - Spain, Simplified Chinese, Korean, Russian, Japanese", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4909330/f483501aade6d0497ebd4e4a66e2b3d14089320b/header.jpg?t=1783514145", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4909330/e69607721f84975af26670b11abe3586e2c45b3a/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1783514145", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4909330/e69607721f84975af26670b11abe3586e2c45b3a/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1783514145", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS *:</strong> Windows 7/8/8.1/10/11 64 Bit;<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 4 cor